## Overview

This stack runs encrypted proxy tunnels as Docker services, managed by a single
Compose file (Portainer-ready). Two independent egress paths are available:

| Path | Protocols | Best for |
|------|-----------|----------|
| **CDN** | VLESS + WebSocket over TLS | Networks that block direct server IPs; hides behind Cloudflare's edge |
| **Direct** | Hysteria2, VLESS Vision, VLESS XHTTP Reality | Performance-sensitive use; no CDN hop |

TLS certificates for all domains are issued automatically by the bundled
`certbot` container using Cloudflare DNS-01 validation (no open inbound port 80
required). Outbound traffic can optionally be routed through a Cloudflare WARP
container for an additional layer of indirection.

