{{CDN_SECTION}}{{DIRECT_SECTION}}{{HEALTHCHECK_SECTION}}{{WARP_SECTION}}## TLS Certificates

The `certbot` service handles issuance and renewal for all configured domains.
It uses Cloudflare DNS-01 so the server never needs to expose port 80.

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Domains | `{{DOMAINS_CSV}}` |
| Host SSL dir | `{{SSL_DIR}}` |
| Contact email | `{{CERT_EMAIL}}` |
| Cloudflare API token | `{{CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN}}` |

Certificates are stored under `{{SSL_DIR}}/live/<domain>/` and mounted
read-only into proxy containers.

